            [hipblasOperation_t]
            indicates whether matrix A is tranposed (conjugated) or not.

        m (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            number of rows of matrix A.

        n (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            number of columns of matrix A.

        kl (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            number of sub-diagonals of A.

        ku (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
