            [hipblasFillMode_t]
            - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_UPPER: the upper triangular part of the Hermitian matrix A is supplied in AP.
            - HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER: the lower triangular part of the Hermitian matrix A is supplied in AP.

