              The matrix is compacted so that AP contains the triangular portion column-by-column
              so that:
              AP(0) = A(0,0)
              AP(1) = A(1,0)
              AP(2) = A(2,1), and so forth.
                  Ex: (HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER; n = 4)
