                   1 0 0 0 0        ->      1 2 3 4 5
                   6 2 0 0 0        ->      6 7 8 9 0
                   9 7 3 0 0        ->      9 8 7 0 0
                   0 8 8 4 0        ->      0 0 0 0 0
                   0 0 7 9 5        ->      0 0 0 0 0

        lda (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            specifies the leading dimension of each A_i. lda must satisfy lda > k.

        x (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.ListOfPointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *INOUT*:
            device array of device pointer storing each vector x_i.

        incx (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            specifies the increment for the elements of each x_i.

        batchCount (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
