              The matrix is compacted so that the main diagonal resides on the 0'th row,
              working up to the k'th diagonal residing on the LHS of the k'th row.
                 Ex: (HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_LOWER; n = 5; k = 2)
                    1 0 0 0 0     ->         1 2 3 4 5
