        n (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            n specifies the number of rows of each b_i. n >= 0.

        k (:py:obj:`~.int`) -- *IN*:
            [int]
            - if(uplo == HIPBLAS_FILL_MODE_UPPER),
