    If ``cs_type`` is real:

        x := c * x + s * y
        y := c * y - s * x

    If ``cs_type`` is complex, the imaginary part of ``c`` is ignored:

        x := real(c) * x + s * y
        y := real(c) * y - conj(s) * x

